# Knobs at their limits on a full-scale sweep: small and dark, then huge and bright, then the endless top, with a
# freeze note on top; output stays clean and below 0 dBFS.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2
track fx2
input sweep 30 16000 0.99
preset 0 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p1 255 8
param p2 255 8
param p1 240 16
note 20 C4 6 127
param p2 0 24
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
